# Copied into a throwaway project and run from there by the generator's own
# tests (`TempProject.copyFixture`/`runScript`); it imports the `app_shared`
# package that fixture generates on the fly, which is not — and must not be —
# a real dependency of this package. Excluding it from the published archive
# keeps pub's static analysis from flagging that import as a missing
# dependency, without touching what the tests read from the source tree.
